  "solution": "Given equation: 96 − 12 ÷ 6 + 3 × 5 = 17.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) **÷ and -**\n\nGiven: 96 − 12 ÷ 6 + 3 × 5 = 17.\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**96 ÷ 12**__ - 6 + 3 × 5 = 17\n\n⇒ 8 - 6 + __**3 × 5**__ = 17\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 6 __**+ 15 **__= 17\n\n⇒ __**23 - 6**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 17 = 17\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 96 − 12 ÷ 6 + 3 × 5 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 96 − 12 × 6 + __**3 ÷ 5**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 96 − __**12 **____**×**____** 6**__ + 0.6 = 17\n\n⇒ __**96**__ − 72 __**+ 0.6**__ = 17\n\n⇒ __**96.06 − 72**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 24.06 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) + and -\n\nGiven: 96 − 12 ÷ 6 + 3 × 5 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 96 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ - 3 × 5 = 17\n\n⇒ 96 + 2 - __**3 × 5**__ = 17\n\n⇒ __**96 +**____** 2**__ - 15 = 17\n\n⇒ __**98 -**____** 15**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 83 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\nGiven: 96 − 12 ÷ 6 + 3 × 5 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 96 − __**12 ÷ 6**__ × 3 + 5 = 17\n\n⇒ 96 − __2** × 3**__ + 5 = 17\n\n⇒ __**96**__ − 6 __**+ 5**__ = 17\n\n⇒ **__101 - 6__** = 17\n\n⇒ 95 ≠ 17\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
